BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Ground contact tests</h1>
Delta-gliders on the SLF runway: at rest, dropped from 3 m, a hard
landing (3 m/s down), and braking from 30 m/s. The script checks that
they come to rest on their gear without sinking in, bouncing away or
creeping.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/ContactTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship REST
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET REST
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
REST:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -80.6838740 28.5988713
  HEADING 330.01
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
DROP:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -80.6851539 28.6008186
  HEADING 330.01
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
HARD:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -80.6864339 28.6027658
  HEADING 330.01
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
BRAKE:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -80.6877138 28.6047131
  HEADING 330.01
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
